+# Fixed upstream test prerequisites
+
+These eight helpers are used only by setup blocks in ten vendored test suites (fourteen references). Files match the exact consumer commits recorded in source-lock.json; the identical UNTAR definitions are shared. Production module versions and modules.json remain unchanged. Upstream MIT license is included.
+
+Discovery and definition availability do not certify native execution, databases, snapshots, tool accuracy, or container readiness. In particular the original HiFi downloader uses a moving database URL; validate and lock its actual data before a native scientific test.
